      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The layout-agent harness: board math, the model-facing catalog, the session service, and the run viewer. What the agent can do — tools, session lifecycle, perception — is owned by design; this area records the registration seam and the placement rules that keep the registered surface honest."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
