        {
          "insert": ". Future external adapters consume the shared authoring export rather than copying the internal system prompt. Changes to shared guidance and its vocabulary dependencies are included in evaluation style fingerprints. Core philosophy and the quality checklist are canonical Prompt Kit content covered by the prompt fingerprint."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
